# Engine checks against the real DragonRules: the score multiplier factor, the per-player super jackpot value and
# the cheat key byte. Expected values are literals from the rule specs / sibling scripts, never recomputed here.
# Multiplier (Rules set: ScoreMultiplier is the factor): NewGame leaves 1; s_oneway5 step 1 is 25,000 (D-CORE dc_superjackpot.uh), step 2 is
#   75,000. The real WellSinkControl (mode 8, state 1; D-SHOP shop_well_s1.uh) writes the factor 5, so step 2 scores 75,000 x 5 = 375,000
#   (a value the rules write directly, not an index into Space Cadet's 5-entry table), while AddSuperJackpot (+200,000 per hit) is not multiplied.
# Super jackpot: per-player save / restore across SwitchToNextPlayer (player 2 starts at 20,000, dm_two.uh M3;
#   player 1 keeps 2,500,000 + 2 x 200,000, player 2 220,000 after one hit). The AddScore accumulate branch (flag on, cap 20,000,000
#   by AddScore) is not reachable here: Dragon never sets the flag; only IU3b_rules_dragon.uh's stub rules do.
# Key byte: `type 1MAX` reaches DragonRules::BackdoorKey (extra ball, text 3011), the same VK path as D-G1/d_1max.uh.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init dump_period 10
init watch super_jackpot
init option Players 2
2 key down new_game
3 key up new_game
20 expect multiplier == 1
20 expect super_jackpot == 2500000
50 poke info_text_box message_field 2
60 event s_oneway5 ControlCollision
63 expect n_score == 25000 delta 59
63 expect super_jackpot == 200000 delta 59
100 poke info_text_box message_field 8
101 poke a_sink4 message_field 1
105 event a_sink4 ControlCollision
106 expect multiplier == 5
110 poke info_text_box message_field 2
120 event s_oneway5 ControlCollision
123 expect n_score == 375000 delta 119
123 expect super_jackpot == 200000 delta 119
130 msg table SwitchToNextPlayer 0
140 expect current_player == 1
140 expect super_jackpot == 20000
150 poke info_text_box message_field 2
160 event s_oneway5 ControlCollision
163 expect super_jackpot == 200000 delta 159
170 msg table SwitchToNextPlayer 0
180 expect current_player == 0
180 expect super_jackpot == 2900000
190 msg table SwitchToNextPlayer 0
200 expect current_player == 1
200 expect super_jackpot == 220000
210 type 1MAX
250 expect extra_balls == 1
213 expect text info_text_box display id 3011
300 quit
